{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"function maxIterations(max): AgentLoopStrategy;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/agent-loop-strategies.ts#L26","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/activities/chat/agent-loop-strategies.ts:26"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Creates a strategy that continues for a maximum number of "},{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"model turns"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n(iterations), not tool calls."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"One iteration can still emit many parallel tool calls. For a tool-call\nbudget, use middleware with "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onBeforeToolCall"},{"type":"text","value":" (per-turn cap) and\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onShouldContinue"},{"type":"text","value":" (cumulative run budget) — see the docs recipe under\nAgentic Cycle."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"max","children":[{"type":"text","value":"max"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"number"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Maximum number of model turns to allow"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/AgentLoopStrategy.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"AgentLoopStrategy"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"AgentLoopStrategy that stops after max iterations"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"const stream = chat({\n  adapter: openaiText(),\n  model: \"gpt-4o\",\n  messages: [...],\n  tools: [weatherTool],\n  agentLoopStrategy: maxIterations(3), // Max 3 model turns\n});","lang":"typescript"}],"headings":[{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"max","text":"max","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction maxIterations(max): AgentLoopStrategy;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/agent-loop-strategies.ts:26](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/agent-loop-strategies.ts#L26)\n\nCreates a strategy that continues for a maximum number of **model turns**\n(iterations), not tool calls.\n\nOne iteration can still emit many parallel tool calls. For a tool-call\nbudget, use middleware with `onBeforeToolCall` (per-turn cap) and\n`onShouldContinue` (cumulative run budget) — see the docs recipe under\nAgentic Cycle.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### max\n\n`number`\n\nMaximum number of model turns to allow\n\n## Returns\n\n[`AgentLoopStrategy`](../type-aliases/AgentLoopStrategy.md)\n\nAgentLoopStrategy that stops after max iterations\n\n## Example\n\n```typescript\nconst stream = chat({\n  adapter: openaiText(),\n  model: \"gpt-4o\",\n  messages: [...],\n  tools: [weatherTool],\n  agentLoopStrategy: maxIterations(3), // Max 3 model turns\n});\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: maxIterations\ntitle: maxIterations\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction maxIterations(max): AgentLoopStrategy;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/agent-loop-strategies.ts:26](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/agent-loop-strategies.ts#L26)\n\nCreates a strategy that continues for a maximum number of **model turns**\n(iterations), not tool calls.\n\nOne iteration can still emit many parallel tool calls. For a tool-call\nbudget, use middleware with `onBeforeToolCall` (per-turn cap) and\n`onShouldContinue` (cumulative run budget) — see the docs recipe under\nAgentic Cycle.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### max\n\n`number`\n\nMaximum number of model turns to allow\n\n## Returns\n\n[`AgentLoopStrategy`](../type-aliases/AgentLoopStrategy.md)\n\nAgentLoopStrategy that stops after max iterations\n\n## Example\n\n```typescript\nconst stream = chat({\n  adapter: openaiText(),\n  model: \"gpt-4o\",\n  messages: [...],\n  tools: [weatherTool],\n  agentLoopStrategy: maxIterations(3), // Max 3 model turns\n});\n```\n"}
